002	EXO	002	001	And there went a man of the house of Levi, and took to wife a daughter of Levi.
002	EXO	002	002	And the woman conceived, and bare a son: and when she saw him that he was a goodly child, she hid him three months.
002	EXO	002	003	And when she could not longer hide him, she took for him an ark of bulrushes, and daubed it with slime and with pitch; and she put the child therein, and laid it in the flags by the river’s brink.
