002	EXO	035	015	and the altar of incense, and its staves, and the anointing oil, and the sweet incense, and the screen for the door, at the door of the tabernacle;
002	EXO	035	016	the altar of burnt offering, with its grating of brass, its staves, and all its vessels, the laver and its base;
002	EXO	035	017	the hangings of the court, the pillars thereof, and their sockets, and the screen for the gate of the court;
002	EXO	035	018	the pins of the tabernacle, and the pins of the court, and their cords;
