003	LEV	004	015	And the elders of the congregation shall lay their hands upon the head of the bullock before the LORD: and the bullock shall be killed before the LORD.
003	LEV	004	016	And the anointed priest shall bring of the blood of the bullock to the tent of meeting:
003	LEV	004	017	and the priest shall dip his finger in the blood, and sprinkle it seven times before the LORD, before the veil.
003	LEV	004	018	And he shall put of the blood upon the horns of the altar which is before the LORD, that is in the tent of meeting, and all the blood shall he pour out at the base of the altar of burnt offering, which is at the door of the tent of meeting.
