003	LEV	011	014	and the kite, and the falcon after its kind;
003	LEV	011	015	every raven after its kind;
003	LEV	011	016	and the ostrich, and the night hawk, and the seamew, and the hawk after its kind;
003	LEV	011	017	and the little owl, and the cormorant, and the great owl;
003	LEV	011	018	and the horned owl, and the pelican, and the vulture;
003	LEV	011	019	and the stork, the heron after its kind, and the hoopoe, and the bat.
