005	DEU	010	001	At that time the LORD said unto me, Hew thee two tables of stone like unto the first, and come up unto me into the mount, and make thee an ark of wood.
005	DEU	010	002	And I will write on the tables the words that were on the first tables which thou brakest, and thou shalt put them in the ark.
