005	DEU	011	022	For if ye shall diligently keep all this commandment which I command you, to do it; to love the LORD your God, to walk in all his ways, and to cleave unto him;
005	DEU	011	023	then will the LORD drive out all these nations from before you, and ye shall possess nations greater and mightier than yourselves.
005	DEU	011	024	Every place whereon the sole of your foot shall tread shall be yours: from the wilderness, and Lebanon, from the river, the river Euphrates, even unto the hinder sea shall be your border.
