005	DEU	011	026	Behold, I set before you this day a blessing and a curse;
005	DEU	011	027	the blessing, if ye shall hearken unto the commandments of the LORD your God, which I command you this day:
005	DEU	011	028	and the curse, if ye shall not hearken unto the commandments of the LORD your God, but turn aside out of the way which I command you this day, to go after other gods, which ye have not known.
005	DEU	011	029	And it shall come to pass, when the LORD thy God shall bring thee into the land whither thou goest to possess it, that thou shalt set the blessing upon mount Gerizim, and the curse upon mount Ebal.
