005	DEU	012	012	and ye shall rejoice before the LORD your God, ye, and your sons, and your daughters, and your menservants, and your maidservants, and the Levite that is within your gates, forasmuch as he hath no portion nor inheritance with you.
005	DEU	012	013	Take heed to thyself that thou offer not thy burnt offerings in every place that thou seest:
