005	DEU	012	032	What thing soever I command you, that shall ye observe to do: thou shalt not add thereto, nor diminish from it.
005	DEU	013	001	If there arise in the midst of thee a prophet, or a dreamer of dreams, and he give thee a sign or a wonder,
005	DEU	013	002	and the sign or the wonder come to pass, whereof he spake unto thee, saying, Let us go after other gods, which thou hast not known, and let us serve them;
005	DEU	013	003	thou shalt not hearken unto the words of that prophet, or unto that dreamer of dreams: for the LORD your God proveth you, to know whether ye love the LORD your God with all your heart and with all your soul.
