005	DEU	014	012	But these are they of which ye shall not eat: the eagle, and the gier eagle, and the ospray;
005	DEU	014	013	and the glede, and the falcon, and the kite after its kind;
005	DEU	014	014	and every raven after its kind;
005	DEU	014	015	and the ostrich, and the night hawk, and the seamew, and the hawk after its kind;
005	DEU	014	016	the little owl, and the great owl, and the horned owl;
005	DEU	014	017	and the pelican, and the vulture, and the cormorant;
005	DEU	014	018	and the stork, and the heron after its kind, and the hoopoe, and the bat.
