005	DEU	029	001	These are the words of the covenant which the LORD commanded Moses to make with the children of Israel in the land of Moab, beside the covenant which he made with them in Horeb.
005	DEU	029	002	And Moses called unto all Israel, and said unto them, Ye have seen all that the LORD did before your eyes in the land of Egypt unto Pharaoh, and unto all his servants, and unto all his land;
005	DEU	029	003	the great temptations which thine eyes saw, the signs, and those great wonders:
005	DEU	029	004	but the LORD hath not given you an heart to know, and eyes to see, and ears to hear, unto this day.
