005	DEU	032	050	and die in the mount whither thou goest up, and be gathered unto thy people; as Aaron thy brother died in mount Hor, and was gathered unto his people:
005	DEU	032	051	because ye trespassed against me in the midst of the children of Israel at the waters of Meribah of Kadesh, in the wilderness of Zin; because ye sanctified me not in the midst of the children of Israel.
005	DEU	032	052	For thou shalt see the land before thee; but thou shalt not go thither into the land which I give the children of Israel.
005	DEU	033	001	And this is the blessing, wherewith Moses the man of God blessed the children of Israel before his death.
005	DEU	033	002	And he said, The LORD came from Sinai, And rose from Seir unto them; He shined forth from mount Paran, And he came from the ten thousands of holy ones: At his right hand was a fiery law unto them.
005	DEU	033	003	Yea, he loveth the peoples; All his saints are in thy hand: And they sat down at thy feet; [Every one] shall receive of thy words.
005	DEU	033	004	Moses commanded us a law, An inheritance for the assembly of Jacob.
