007	JDG	001	001	And it came to pass after the death of Joshua, that the children of Israel asked of the LORD, saying, Who shall go up for us first against the Canaanites, to fight against them?
007	JDG	001	002	And the LORD said, Judah shall go up: behold, I have delivered the land into his hand.
007	JDG	001	003	And Judah said unto Simeon his brother, Come up with me into my lot, that we may fight against the Canaanites; and I likewise will go with thee into thy lot. So Simeon went with him.
