007	JDG	021	015	And the people repented them for Benjamin, because that the LORD had made a breach in the tribes of Israel.
007	JDG	021	016	Then the elders of the congregation said, How shall we do for wives for them that remain, seeing the women are destroyed out of Benjamin?
007	JDG	021	017	And they said, There must be an inheritance for them that are escaped of Benjamin, that a tribe be not blotted out from Israel.
