009	1SA	003	015	And Samuel lay until the morning, and opened the doors of the house of the LORD. And Samuel feared to shew Eli the vision.
009	1SA	003	016	Then Eli called Samuel, and said, Samuel, my son. And he said, Here Am I.
009	1SA	003	017	And he said, What is the thing that [the LORD] hath spoken unto thee? I pray thee hide it not from me: God do so to thee, and more also, if thou hide any thing from me of all the things that he spake unto thee.
