009	1SA	025	026	Now therefore, my lord, as the LORD liveth, and as thy soul liveth, seeing the LORD hath withholden thee from bloodguiltiness, and from avenging thyself with thine own hand, now therefore let thine enemies, and them that seek evil to my lord, be as Nabal.
009	1SA	025	027	And now this present which thy servant hath brought unto my lord, let it be given unto the young men that follow my lord.
