011	1KI	001	001	Now king David was old and stricken in years; and they covered him with clothes, but he gat no heat.
011	1KI	001	002	Wherefore his servants said unto him, Let there be sought for my lord the king a young virgin: and let her stand before the king, and cherish him; and let her lie in thy bosom, that my lord the king may get heat.
