011	1KI	008	054	And it was so, that when Solomon had made an end of praying all this prayer and supplication unto the LORD, he arose from before the altar of the LORD, from kneeling on his knees with his hands spread forth toward heaven.
011	1KI	008	055	And he stood, and blessed all the congregation of Israel with a loud voice, saying,
