011	1KI	021	016	And it came to pass, when Ahab heard that Naboth was dead, that Ahab rose up to go down to the vineyard of Naboth the Jezreelite, to take possession of it.
011	1KI	021	017	And the word of the LORD came to Elijah the Tishbite, saying,
