012	2KI	005	019	And he said unto him, Go in peace. So he departed from him a little way.
012	2KI	005	020	But Gehazi, the servant of Elisha the man of God, said, Behold, my master hath spared this Naaman the Syrian, in not receiving at his hands that which he brought: as the LORD liveth, I will run after him, and take somewhat of him.
