012	2KI	017	037	and the statutes and the ordinances, and the law and the commandment, which he wrote for you, ye shall observe to do for evermore; and ye shall not fear other gods:
012	2KI	017	038	and the covenant that I have made with you ye shall not forget; neither shall ye fear other gods:
012	2KI	017	039	but the LORD your God shall ye fear; and he shall deliver you out of the hand of all your enemies.
