012	2KI	018	032	Until I come and take you away to a land like your own land, a land of corn and wine, a land of bread and vineyards, a land of oil olive and of honey, that ye may live, and not die: and hearken not unto Hezekiah, when he persuadeth you, saying, The LORD will deliver us.
012	2KI	018	033	Hath any of the gods of the nations ever delivered his land out of the hand of the king of Assyria?
