014	2CH	001	008	And Solomon said unto God, Thou hast shewed great kindness unto David my father, and hast made me king in his stead.
014	2CH	001	009	Now, O LORD God, let thy promise unto David my father be established: for thou hast made me king over a people like the dust of the earth in multitude.
014	2CH	001	010	Give me now wisdom and knowledge, that I may go out and come in before this people: for who can judge this thy people, that is so great?
