015	EZR	001	010	thirty bowls of gold, silver bowls of a second sort four hundred and ten, and other vessels a thousand.
015	EZR	001	011	All the vessels of gold and of silver were five thousand and four hundred. All these did Sheshbazzar bring up, when they of the captivity were brought up from Babylon unto Jerusalem.
