016	NEH	003	004	And next unto them repaired Meremoth the son of Uriah, the son of Hakkoz. And next unto them repaired Meshullam the son of Berechiah, the son of Meshezabel. And next unto them repaired Zadok the son of Baana.
016	NEH	003	005	And next unto them the Tekoites repaired; but their nobles put not their necks to the work of their lord.
