016	NEH	011	016	and Shabbethai and Jozabad, of the chiefs of the Levites, who had the oversight of the outward business of the house of God;
016	NEH	011	017	and Mattaniah the son of Mica, the son of Zabdi, the son of Asaph, who was the chief to begin the thanksgiving in prayer, and Bakbukiah, the second among his brethren; and Abda the son of Shammua, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun.
016	NEH	011	018	All the Levites in the holy city were two hundred fourscore and four.
