023	ISA	008	007	now therefore, behold, the Lord bringeth up upon them the waters of the River, strong and many, [even] the king of Assyria and all his glory: and he shall come up over all his channels, and go over all his banks:
023	ISA	008	008	and he shall sweep onward into Judah; he shall overflow and pass through; he shall reach even to the neck; and the stretching out of his wings shall fill the breadth of thy land, O Immanuel.
023	ISA	008	009	Make an uproar; O ye peoples, and ye shall be broken in pieces; and give ear, all ye of far countries: gird yourselves, and ye shall be broken in pieces: gird yourselves, and ye shall be broken in pieces.
023	ISA	008	010	Take counsel together, and it shall be brought to nought; speak the word, and it shall not stand: for God is with us.
023	ISA	008	011	For the LORD spake thus to me with a strong hand, and instructed me that I should not walk in the way of this people, saying,
