023	ISA	009	011	Therefore the LORD shall set up on high against him the adversaries of Rezin, and shall stir up his enemies;
023	ISA	009	012	the Syrians before, and the Philistines behind, and they shall devour Israel with open mouth. For all this his anger is not turned away, but his hand is stretched out still.
023	ISA	009	013	Yet the people hath not turned unto him that smote them, neither have they sought the LORD of hosts.
023	ISA	009	014	Therefore the LORD will cut off from Israel head and tail, palm-branch and rush, in one day.
023	ISA	009	015	The ancient and the honourable man, he is the head; and the prophet that teacheth lies, he is the tail.
023	ISA	009	016	For they that lead this people cause them to err; and they that are led of them are destroyed.
023	ISA	009	017	Therefore the Lord shall not rejoice over their young men, neither shall he have compassion on their fatherless and widows: for every one is profane and an evil-doer, and every mouth speaketh folly. For all this his anger is not turned away, but his hand is stretched out still.
023	ISA	009	018	For wickedness burneth as the fire; it devoureth the briers and thorns: yea, it kindleth in the thickets of the forest, and they roll upward in thick clouds of smoke.
023	ISA	009	019	Through the wrath of the LORD of hosts is the land burnt up: the people also are as the fuel of fire; no man spareth his brother.
023	ISA	009	020	And one shall snatch on the right hand, and be hungry; and he shall eat on the left hand, and they shall not be satisfied: they shall eat every man the flesh of his own arm:
