023	ISA	010	005	Ho Assyrian, the rod of mine anger, the staff in whose hand is mine indignation!
023	ISA	010	006	I will send him against a profane nation, and against the people of my wrath will I give him a charge, to take the spoil, and to take the prey, and to tread them down like the mire of the streets.
023	ISA	010	007	Howbeit he meaneth not so, neither doth his heart think so; but it is in his heart to destroy, and to cut off nations not a few.
023	ISA	010	008	For he saith, Are not my princes all of them kings?
