023	ISA	011	007	And the cow and the bear shall feed; their young ones shall lie down together: and the lion shall eat straw like the ox.
023	ISA	011	008	And the sucking child shall play on the hole of the asp, and the weaned child shall put his hand on the basilisk’s den.
023	ISA	011	009	They shall not hurt nor destroy in all my holy mountain: for the earth shall be full of the knowledge of the LORD, as the waters cover the sea.
