023	ISA	040	007	The grass withereth, the flower fadeth; because the breath of the LORD bloweth upon it: surely the people is grass.
023	ISA	040	008	The grass withereth, the flower fadeth: but the word of our God shall stand for ever.
023	ISA	040	009	O thou that tellest good tidings to Zion, get thee up into the high mountain: O thou that tellest good tidings to Jerusalem, lift up thy voice with strength; lift it up, be not afraid; say unto the cities of Judah, Behold, your God!
023	ISA	040	010	Behold, the Lord GOD will come as a mighty one, and his arm shall rule for him: behold, his reward is with him, and his recompence before him.
