023	ISA	048	022	There is no peace, saith the LORD, unto the wicked.
023	ISA	049	001	Listen, O isles, unto me; and hearken, ye peoples, from far: the LORD hath called me from the womb; from the bowels of my mother hath he made mention of my name:
023	ISA	049	002	and he hath made my mouth like a sharp sword, in the shadow of his hand hath he hid me; and he hath made me a polished shaft, in his quiver hath he kept me close:
023	ISA	049	003	and he said unto me, Thou art my servant; Israel, in whom I will be glorified.
