023	ISA	052	001	Awake, awake, put on thy strength, O Zion; put on thy beautiful garments, O Jerusalem, the holy city: for henceforth there shall no more come into thee the uncircumcised and the unclean.
023	ISA	052	002	Shake thyself from the dust; arise, sit thee down, O Jerusalem: loose thyself from the bands of thy neck, O captive daughter of Zion,
023	ISA	052	003	For thus saith the LORD, Ye were sold for nought; and ye shall be redeemed without money.
