028	HOS	014	001	O ISRAEL, return unto the LORD thy God; for thou hast fallen by thine iniquity.
028	HOS	014	002	Take with you words, and return unto the LORD: say unto him, Take away all iniquity, and accept that which is good: so will we render [as] bullocks [the offering of] our lips.
