032	JON	001	014	Wherefore they cried unto the LORD, and said, We beseech thee, O LORD, we beseech thee, let us not perish for this man’s life, and lay not upon us innocent blood: for thou, O LORD, hast done as it pleased thee.
032	JON	001	015	So they took up Jonah, and cast him forth into the sea: and the sea ceased from her raging.
