033	MIC	002	004	In that day shall they take up a parable against you, and lament with a doleful lamentation, [and] say, We be utterly spoiled: he changeth the portion of my people: how doth he remove [it] from me! to the rebellious he divideth our fields.
033	MIC	002	005	Therefore thou shalt have none that shall cast the line by lot in the congregation of the LORD.
