038	ZEC	001	015	And I am very sore displeased with the nations that are at ease: for I was but a little displeased, and they helped forward the affliction.
038	ZEC	001	016	Therefore thus saith the LORD: I am returned to Jerusalem with mercies; my house shall be built in it, saith the LORD of hosts, and a line shall be stretched forth over Jerusalem.
038	ZEC	001	017	Cry yet again, saying, Thus saith the LORD of hosts: My cities through prosperity shall yet be spread abroad; and the LORD shall yet comfort Zion, and shall yet choose Jerusalem.
