040	MAT	013	018	Hear then ye the parable of the sower.
040	MAT	013	019	When any one heareth the word of the kingdom, and understandeth it not, [then] cometh the evil [one], and snatcheth away that which hath been sown in his heart. This is he that was sown by the way side.
