041	MAR	004	007	And other fell among the thorns, and the thorns grew up, and choked it, and it yielded no fruit.
041	MAR	004	008	And others fell into the good ground, and yielded fruit, growing up and increasing; and brought forth, thirtyfold, and sixtyfold, and a hundredfold.
041	MAR	004	009	And he said, Who hath ears to hear, let him hear.
