043	JOH	012	028	Father, glorify thy name. There came therefore a voice out of heaven, [saying], I have both glorified it, and will glorify it again.
043	JOH	012	029	The multitude therefore, that stood by, and heard it, said that it had thundered: others said, An angel hath spoken to him.
043	JOH	012	030	Jesus answered and said, This voice hath not come for my sake, but for your sakes.
