043	JOH	012	035	Jesus therefore said unto them, Yet a little while is the light among you. Walk while ye have the light, that darkness overtake you not: and he that walketh in the darkness knoweth not whither he goeth.
043	JOH	012	036	While ye have the light, believe on the light, that ye may become sons of light. These things spake Jesus, and he departed and hid himself from them.
043	JOH	012	037	But though he had done so many signs before them, yet they believed not on him:
