043	JOH	013	019	From henceforth I tell you before it come to pass, that, when it is come to pass, ye may believe that I am [he].
043	JOH	013	020	Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that receiveth whomsoever I send receiveth me; and he that receiveth me receiveth him that sent me.
043	JOH	013	021	When Jesus had thus said, he was troubled in the spirit, and testified, and said, Verily, verily, I say unto you, that one of you shall betray me.
