043	JOH	014	022	Judas (not Iscariot) saith unto him, Lord, what is come to pass that thou wilt manifest thyself unto us, and not unto the world?
043	JOH	014	023	Jesus answered and said unto him, If a man love me, he will keep my word: and my Father will love him, and we will come unto him, and make our abode with him.
043	JOH	014	024	He that loveth me not keepeth not my words: and the word which ye hear is not mine, but the Father’s who sent me.
043	JOH	014	025	These things have I spoken unto you, while [yet] abiding with you.
