044	ACT	002	010	in Phrygia and Pamphylia, in Egypt and the parts of Libya about Cyrene, and sojourners from Rome, both Jews and proselytes,
044	ACT	002	011	Cretans and Arabians, we do hear them speaking in our tongues the mighty works of God.
044	ACT	002	012	And they were all amazed, and were perplexed, saying one to another, What meaneth this?
